! I'm a third-year!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_03_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_03_02_20","text":"Third-years are the highest grade. That makes me the boss of the classroom!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_03_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_03_02_21","text":"\"Seniors are the bosses of the classroom.\" Database updated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_03_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_03_02_22","text":"It appears that's one of the rules of this world. I've learned something new.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_03_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_03_02_23","text":"Hehe, exactly! You really get me, Aigis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_03_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_03_02_24","text":"Anyway, what were you doing over here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ce009_03_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rei","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ce009_03_02_25","text":"It feels like you've been wandering around for a while now...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown